CCTPBridgeModuleFactory_Registry
├── given no modules deployed
│   ├── it should return false from isDeployedModule
│   ├── it should return an empty array from getDeployedModules
│   └── it should return zero from getModuleCount
├── given modules deployed
│   ├── it should return true from isDeployedModule for a deployed module
│   ├── it should return false from isDeployedModule for a non-deployed address
│   ├── it should return false for a module deployed outside the factory with a counterfeit usdc
│   ├── it should return the correct array from getDeployedModules
│   └── it should return the correct count from getModuleCount
└── given a mix of create and createDeterministic deployments
    └── it should track both in the same registry
